{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y在S03、S04、S08等短停留段的信息交替偏密，视线不如X的左右分栏容易快速定位和收束。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y用【】突出每段心理重心，又把感受与音乐具体进程对应起来，观众更容易看懂他为什么既怀念过去、又不愿回去，以及这种矛盾怎样一步步变化。尤其从S06到S13，Y把孤独、对亲近的渴望、不甘心受委屈和最终带着想念继续生活串成了完整的心理过程，音乐感受也有更细的层次变化。X的左右分栏确实更利于快速扫读，但部分右栏内容容易变成孤立的情绪标签，不如Y能让人理解这些感受之间的联系。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "4999a92a-891b-42a6-a202-0eb1aefd5fb4", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T011758381879Z", "elapsed_seconds": 44.109, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T01:18:42.514734+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "c298b0dadb31988dab243f0b77f392e183a2d5d93f58ed1485c64b96527c1d03", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3